      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → OpenRouter → OpenRouter settings**.\n2. Describe the brand in **Brand Brief**.\n3. Press **Run**. The logo is saved as an SVG file and as a PNG sticker with a transparent background."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
