        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Write Logo Prompts** answers with three prompts as JSON, and Jev picks the strongest in **Best Prompt**. **Vector Logo** draws it as SVG for **Save Logo**, and **Sticker** draws it on a transparent background.\n\n**Sticker Mask** shows the transparency the model returned; white marks the transparent area.\n\nFour paid requests per run. Prices are in **OpenRouter models**; each request's charge is at openrouter.ai/activity."
      ],
      "title": "Using This Workflow"
    },
